# LLM Fine-tuning Component

This component manages the fine-tuning of large language models for introspection:

## Structure and Main Components
Located in `finetune_introspect-llm/`, this component includes:
- Introspect-medalpaca fine-tuning in `introspect-medalpaca/`
- Model configuration in `introspect-medalpaca/configs/`
- Prompt templates in `introspect-medalpaca/prompt_templates/`

## Key Components
- Configuration files define model parameters and training settings
- Prompt templates structure the input/output format for fine-tuning
- Fine-tuning scripts adapt pre-trained models to introspection tasks

## Data Flow
1. Analysis data from various components is prepared for fine-tuning
2. Prompt templates format the data for model training
3. Configuration files specify the training parameters
4. Fine-tuning scripts update the model weights
5. Evaluation metrics assess model performance
6. Fine-tuned models are deployed to the chatbot interface

## Integration Points
- Consumes data from the prompt engineering component
- Takes insights from knowledge graph components
- Feeds fine-tuned models to the chatbot interface
- Incorporates health and multimedia data patterns

